        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LootMage</strong> is a bullet-hell action roguelite game set in a medieval fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an adventurer in this realm, you must brave ever-changing dungeons, battle fierce enemies, collect treasures, and fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/adfd179553a10aa6e64d0a39cfbed25a.avif?t=1781012138\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/c4cad1b41cbfb60d4746ad9d1f5b6bf7.poster.avif?t=1781012138\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/c4cad1b41cbfb60d4746ad9d1f5b6bf7.webm?t=1781012138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/c4cad1b41cbfb60d4746ad9d1f5b6bf7.mp4?t=1781012138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge relentless waves of enemy attacks and experience thrilling combat with powerful magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're defeated, you'll lose all your items,but the skills and knowledge you've gained will carry over to your next challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to reach the end of the dungeon?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/5355e396230112b41bd61a7a1f7d4600.avif?t=1781012138\" width=600 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/629902aec2bb766da2332a9a4faa6679.poster.avif?t=1781012138\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/629902aec2bb766da2332a9a4faa6679.webm?t=1781012138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is brimming with magic staves, heavy swords, magic orbs, and all sorts of other weapons and items.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you find in the dungeon and how you combine them to continue your journey depends on your luck and choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/97e99f1df1d072f107a83b8e31a468d9.avif?t=1781012138\" width=600 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All passive items contain two distinct magical essences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 2, 4, or 6 items with the same essence to activate a special synergy effect.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/a0be4521c9fea81217d32eb23f4abb68.avif?t=1781012138\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/921badb703f6b3cf61be053e7710a317.poster.avif?t=1781012138\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/921badb703f6b3cf61be053e7710a317.webm?t=1781012138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/921badb703f6b3cf61be053e7710a317.mp4?t=1781012138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mana Stones hold powerful magical energy. The Gauntlet is a special device that channels that power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using Mana Stones to activate Arcs allows you to enhance or alter your combat abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine various projectile options to create your own combat style!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/dff0ae840c4a8cae6c4f21adac91148e.avif?t=1781012138\" width=600 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/67b56ce43835bddcc594206e0c30acea.poster.avif?t=1781012138\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/67b56ce43835bddcc594206e0c30acea.webm?t=1781012138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/67b56ce43835bddcc594206e0c30acea.mp4?t=1781012138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated dungeons that present new challenges each time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe enemy patterns and adapt to shifting terrain as you grow stronger with every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When will you finally master the art of surviving these treacherous depths?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The dungeons of <strong>LootMage</strong> always hold new treasures and challenges awaiting your discovery.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300760/extras/8d3667d2c659165507921c74e98e78c2.avif?t=1781012138\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p>",
